Backend
  In your terminal, run:
  cd /Users/jonathanbeltran/service-center/backend
  source venv/bin/activate
  ADMIN_PASSWORD=yourpassword uvicorn main:app --reload
 You should see Uvicorn running on http://127.0.0.1:8000.

Frontend

  Open both files directly in your browser:
  - frontend/index.html — the worker shift picker
  - frontend/admin.html — the admin panel